sequenceDiagram
    actor Operator
    participant Proxy as Caddy / React SPA
    participant API as NestJS (1 instance)
    participant DB as MongoDB replica set UAT
    Operator->>DB: Backup + manifest (writers stopped)
    Operator->>DB: Restore into new gym_uat_restore_* DB
    Operator->>DB: Compare BSON/counts/indexes/source/ledger/finance
    Operator->>DB: Rehearse migrations on verified restore
    Operator->>DB: Review, then ensure-indexes on UAT
    Operator->>API: Start production config + DEPLOYMENT_ENV=uat
    API->>DB: Validate indexes + write/abort transaction probe
    alt gate fails
        API-->>Operator: STARTUP_FAILED, no HTTP listener
    else gate passes
        API->>API: Start outbox/expiry/reminder workers
        Operator->>API: GET /api/health/ready
        API->>DB: ping
        API-->>Operator: ready / 503
        Operator->>Proxy: Open HTTPS UAT routes
        Proxy->>API: /api/auth/login, refresh, logout (4 roles)
        API->>DB: Authenticate / persist sessions
        API-->>Proxy: HttpOnly Secure SameSite=Lax cookie + response
        Proxy->>API: /socket.io transport, /notifications namespace
        API->>DB: Verify session / sync persisted notifications
        Operator->>Proxy: Browser smoke + EN08 on same commit/URL
    end
